<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Keterangan Lolos Kaji Etik</title>

    <style>
      /* Penyesuaian agar muat satu halaman & persis contoh */
      body {
        font-size: 10.5pt;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .letterhead {
        max-height: 40mm;
      }
      .doc-title {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 4mm 0 4mm;
      }
      .doc-title div {
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .doc-title .t-id {
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-size: 11pt;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
      }
      .research-title {
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .field {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin: 0 0 2px;
      }
      .field .label {
        width: 58mm;
        flex: none;
      }
      .field .label em {
        display: block;
      }
      .field .sep {
        width: 4mm;
        flex: none;
      }
      .field .value {
        flex: 1;
      }
      .approval {
        margin: 6px 0 8px;
      }
      .approval strong {
        display: block;
      }
      .approval em {
        display: block;
      }
      .signature-row {
        display: flex;
        margin-top: 4px;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      .signature {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 0;
        min-height: 0;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .signature-space {
        height: 72px;
      }

      .signature .name {
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .notes {
        font-size: 9.5pt;
        text-align: justify;
        margin-top: 20px;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }
      .footer-art {
        justify-content: flex-start;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      .footer-art .accreditation {
        max-height: 18mm;
        max-width: 40mm;
      }
      .footer-art .accreditation-text {
        font-size: 10.5pt;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <% if (hasKop) { %><img
      class="letterhead"
      src="<%= kopDataUri %>"
      alt="Kop surat"
    />
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="letterhead-placeholder">
      KEMENTERIAN PENDIDIKAN TINGGI, SAINS DAN TEKNOLOGI<strong
        >UNIVERSITAS ANDALAS</strong
      >RUMAH SAKIT UNIVERSITAS ANDALAS<br /><span class="small"
        >Kop surat akan diganti menggunakan aset resmi.</span
      >
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="doc-title">
      <div class="t-id">KETERANGAN LOLOS KAJI ETIK</div>
      <div>DESCRIPTION OF ETHICAL APPROVAL</div>
      <div>Nomor.<%= letterNumber %></div>
    </div>

    <p>
      Tim Komisi Etik Fakultas Kedokteran Universitas Andalas, dalam upaya
      melindungi Hak Asasi dan Kesejahteraan Subjek Penelitian
      kedokteran/Kesehatan, telah mengkaji dengan teliti protocol penelitian
      dengan judul:
      <em
        >(The Research Ethics Committee Universitas Andalas Hospital, in order
        to protect human rights and welfare medical/health research subject, has
        carefully reviewed the research protocol entitled):</em
      >
    </p>

    <p class="research-title">"<%= researchTitle %>"</p>

    <div class="field">
      <div class="label">
        Nama Peneliti Utama<em>Principal Investigator Name</em>
      </div>
      <div class="sep">:</div>
      <div class="value"><%= researcherName %></div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <div class="label">
        Nomor Induk Mahasiswa<em>Student ID<br />Principal Researcher</em>
      </div>
      <div class="sep">:</div>
      <div class="value"><%= researcherId %></div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <div class="label">Nama Institusi<em>Institution</em></div>
      <div class="sep">:</div>
      <div class="value"><%= institution %></div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <div class="label">
        Nomor Registrasi Etik<em>Ethics Registration Number</em>
      </div>
      <div class="sep">:</div>
      <div class="value"><%= applicationNumber %></div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <div class="label">Masa Berlaku<em>Validity Period</em></div>
      <div class="sep">:</div>
      <div class="value">1 Tahun Sejak Dokumen Ini di Terbitkan</div>
    </div>

    <div class="approval">
      <strong
        >Protokol Penelitian tersebut dapat disetujui pelaksanaannya</strong
      >
      <em>and approved the research protocol.</em>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-row">
      <div class="signature">
        <br />Direktur Utama<br />Rumah Sakit Universitas Andalas
        <div class="signature-space"></div>
        <div class="name">MUHAMMAD RIENDRA</div>
        <div>NIP: 197604082005011007</div>
      </div>
      <div class="signature">
        Padang, <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID', { day: 'numeric',
        month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %><br />
        Ketua<br />Komite Etik Penelitian Rumah Sakit Universitas Andalas
        <div class="signature-space"></div>
        <div class="name">Prof. dr. Nur Indrawaty Liputo, MSc, PhD, Sp.GK</div>
        <div>NIP: 196305071990012001</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notes">
      <strong>Keterangan/notes:</strong><br />
      Keterangan lolos kaji etik ini berlaku satu tahun dari tanggal persetujuan
      <em>This ethical approval is effective for one year from the due date</em>
      Jika ada kejadian serius yang tidak diinginkan (KTD) harus segera
      dilaporkan ke Komite Etik Penelitian
      <em
        >If there are Serious Adverse Events (SAE) should be immediately
        reported to the Research Ethics Committee</em
      >
    </div>

  </body>
</html>
